pyruvate, and lactate-to-pyruvate ratio during exercise and recovery</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>1985</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>935</fpage><lpage>940</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4055579</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>